    { "id": "note_6_hello", "body": "Everything here is a Note — the tree, the toolbar, the layout itself, and every file in this repo.\n\nThe pane on the left is the repo. Click a file to open it; what you type is written to disk.\n\nDrag the divider between panes. Double-click empty canvas for a Cell. Cmd+D for a second pin of the same Note." },
    { "id": "note_7_cell", "body": "// Shift+Enter runs this. Cmd+Enter runs and moves down.\n// `host` is this pin's Host; a Cell holds `shell` and `fs`.\nexport default async (host) => (await host.fs().git(['status', '--short'])).stdout || 'clean';\n" },
